argon-utils (0.1.12) unstable; urgency=medium

  * postinst asks the bus daemon to reload its policy once the argon user
    exists. On a first install the daemon had already reloaded when the
    policy file was unpacked -- before the user existed -- and dropped the
    rule naming it, so argond was refused its bus name until the next
    reload. Seen on a fresh install on the ONE UP.
  * Desktop notifications say "Battery", like the tray, instead of "UPS".

